Rs. 10 each, at an issue price of Rs.167 per share (including a share premium of Rs. 157 per share), comprising entirely of &lt;br /&gt; 
a fresh issue aggregating to Rs. 90.17 Crores. The equity shares of the Company were listed on National Stock Exchange &lt;br /&gt; 
of India Limited (NSE) and BSE Limited (BSE) on 6 October 2026. Accordingly, the Unaudited Consolidated Financial &lt;br /&gt; 
Results for the Quarter Ended 30 September 2026 have been drawn up for the first time, in accordance with the listing &lt;br /&gt; 
requirements. &lt;br /&gt; 
The Company received share application money amounting to Rs. 40.00 Crores from anchor investors on 25 September &lt;br /&gt; 
2026 in connection with its Initial Public Offering (IPO). Out of the aforesaid amount, Rs. 27.05 Crores were allocated to &lt;br /&gt; 
anchor investors on 25 September 2026, and the balance amount of share application money Rs. 12.95 Crores was &lt;br /&gt; 
outstanding as at 30 September 2026 and has been classified under other financial liabilities as share application money &lt;br /&gt; 
pending refund. &lt;br /&gt; 
 &lt;br /&gt; 
2. The Un-audited Consolidated Financial Results of Shah Investor's Home Limited (“the Company”) and its Subsidiaries &lt;br /&gt; 
(together referred to as 'Group') for the quarter ended 30 September, 2026 have been prepared in accordance with &lt;br /&gt; 
Indian Accounting Standards (“IND AS”) as prescribed under Section 133 of the Companies Act, 2013, read with &lt;br /&gt; 
Companies (Indian Accounting Standards) Rules, 2015, applicable provisions of SEBI (Listing Obligations &amp; Disclosure &lt;br /&gt; 
Requirements) Regulations, 2015, as amended from time to time, and have been duly reviewed and recommended by &lt;br /&gt; 
the Audit Committee and approved by the Board of Directors at their respective meetings held on 14 November 2026. &lt;br /&gt; 
 &lt;br /&gt; 
3. Limited Review of the aforesaid Financial Results for the quarter ended 30 September 2026 has been carried out by the &lt;br /&gt; 
Statutory Auditors, and they have issued Limited Review Report with unmodified conclusion thereon. &lt;br /&gt; 
 &lt;br /&gt; 
4. The statement of standalone unaudited financial results includes results for the quarter ended 30 September, 2025, the &lt;br /&gt; 
